    - Renamed `RuntimeClaims` field to `RunTimeClaims` to align with `InitTimeClaims` type name; standardized spelling of
      `InitTimeClaims`.
    - Changed input parameter to `AttestTpm` to be `AttestTpmOptions` instead of `std::string`.
